<title>BULGARIA: SOCCER-SLOVAKIA BEAT BULGARIA 1-0 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SLOVAKIA BEAT BULGARIA 1-0 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia beat Bulgaria 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in a friendly soccer international on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Jozef Majoros 84</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,000</p>
